  <item>
    <title>EP 82｜沉迷“X调查”的我们，why why why</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f2da029a7ce76acad07d43</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f2da029a7ce76acad07d43</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 04:38:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>某次聊天突然发现我们都是“X调查”的资深粉丝，于是有了这一集！</span></p><p><strong><span>💌双周update💌</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong><span>新插画书卖爆🔥预定渠道直接小红书🔍茱莉亚高 私信联系🔥</span></strong><br><span>* 首刷 25 本一小時內賣完，二刷直接加了兩倍的量… 在瘋狂簽名，五一要瘋狂包貨啦</span><br><span>* 銷售所得一半捐贈給台灣待用課程公益協會，投入偏鄉藝術教育</span><br><span>* 打算投一些出版社，沒有受到青睞就打算在台灣拿書號，來聯繫各個獨立的藝術書店</span></p></li></ul><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8jUSbWW8h57GJX56cKgNKRWDOg.jpg"></figure><ol><li><p><span>Alice开始analog life，减少屏幕时间，胶片相机（我终于洗了2年前夏天的公路旅行胶卷，两卷，还报废一卷，虽然我完全不记得哪一卷里是什么内容了），cd机，纸质阅读。贴两张我新洗的🎞️</span></p></li></ol><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoRVDsajektQIEizxR-k9TwbPtjp.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfxQj5LBUze8IhERgM1smp8exK_.png"></figure><ul><li><p><strong><span>Julia英国艺术院校录取！</span></strong><br></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>📒Show notes📒</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> 闲聊开始，这两周我俩都干了啥</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="881">14:41</a> 进入正题，“X调查”是什么节目</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 很疯的韩女运用AI犯案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1543">25:43</a> 这个案件对我们有什么启示么，如何避免悲剧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a> 未来AI能协助案件办理吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 看“X调查”这么多案件，有哪些犯罪规律？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> always the husband</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 为什么会沉迷凶杀案/悬疑案呢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 我对真实事件的深度非常热爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 延展：Julia和Alice的阅读偏爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2516">41:56</a> 类似X调查的节目推荐，铛铛铛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">43:13</a> 医师建议吃饭不要看这么刺激的哦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2719">45:19</a> “X调查”的Will帮我们结尾</span></p><p></p><p><span>That's it! </span></p><p><span>大家五一快乐哦❤️</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63397169bf02f153ce0caa9c/lpX--nxWd4Yg3SD8wTiu9pL8UN2u.m4a" length="44826451" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhb9DGQXy6c1JPUV9LrG-g85-UvI.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP 81｜我被网暴了吗？mini的那种</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d7826de2c8be3155c83523</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d7826de2c8be3155c83523</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家最近如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我又杀回来啦！Mandy还在宇宙流浪，于是携手另一位台湾女孩儿Julia✨，继续播客🎙️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🌸Julia简介🌸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>台湾人住在上海，白天在北欧家具厂做行销，下班后左手抱猫，右手画画，在往出版自己的第一本绘本迈进的路上。有兴趣欢迎小红书搜寻🔍</span><strong><span>茱莉亞高</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXIPWR1V6oRHvS7JlNqOFRT3vES.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>📖本集大纲📖</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 开头点这里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="346">05:46</a> 后面播客有何计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 最近一次跟Julia见面，在上海一个阳光明媚的下午☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 这次“网暴”，居然是因为一张Julia拍的我和男友的合影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 不管评论的内容真假，收到的伤害是真实的💔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> 这个事件发生的逻辑有哪些？</span><strong><span>算法+匿名账号的去抑制+性别对立</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">34:37</a> 面对恶意，有什么行动建议呢？</span><strong><span>不陷入自证</span></strong><span>+</span><strong><span>升维打击+共情听众</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2543">42:23</a> 劲爆环节来了，那些猪精都说了啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">48:57</a> 恶意是随机的，而</span><strong><span>善意是永远存在的💞</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a> 非常感谢Julia和所有举报的，或者是私信安慰我的大家。并不会因为这些无脑评论而改变我的发帖方式✌️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最后祝大家有一个爽爽人生🍀</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我的Red在这里，欢迎关注，帮我回怼🤣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmKQPO9zDdRB-pMJ0uVjnZnpDhR7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>播客听友群二维码在这里，来聊聊呀🤑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLFJCFyBVMSck4NfA6nAlE1cYDN.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj81ucgcOPJsUBACLBQJgjlercM6.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63397169bf02f153ce0caa9c/lq2-E5GhWFGY07VxTWTBig4hxoO-.m4a" length="51638632" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhb9DGQXy6c1JPUV9LrG-g85-UvI.jpg"/>
