  <item>
    <title>EP 79｜“好女人得名声，坏女人得一切”是真的，科学玄学双修指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689841d5032793b18aa02436</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689841d5032793b18aa02436</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期建议反复听，希望你们内化习得💞人生up up 🔝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容节奏：→ 从心理结构 → 社会设定 → 能量频率 &amp; 脑科学 → 显化力量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️SHOWNOTES🎙️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 此部分是爱姐获得显化灵感的内容</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> 真开头</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 标题里的好女人和坏女人，指什么</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 第一个部分：心理结构</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> 强化心理结构的tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">10:06</a> 个人分享：我第一次误打误撞考到年级第一，从此开挂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> 逆商在强化心理结构非常重要，分享德国留学后找工作不顺利时期没有怂</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 第二部分：社会的设定</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 人之所以为人，基础是要做开心充盈的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1704">28:24</a> 跳出好人陷阱，做到精神独立和精神独立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1782">29:42</a> 有余力，改变你能改变的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 第三部分：我们要讲的是能量频率和脑科学</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 勇敢向宇宙要订单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> 自己跟自己对话，给自己洗脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 遇到自我怀疑，也许并不是错的，不要压抑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 从没分享过，我第一份实习是时尚编辑助理哈哈哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 如何调整能量频率？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 第4部分：显化力量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2966">49:26</a> 关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> 事业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 金钱是能量，能感受到的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3902">1:05:02</a> 商业运营的本质，是交换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4104">1:08:24</a> 居住环境的小玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4328">1:12:08</a> 结尾：祝听了的都发财</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀🍀</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>📒能量笔记</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>肯定语句</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>写感恩日记</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冥想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>散步</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>🔮显化技巧</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>清楚知道自己要什么 - </span><strong><span>清晰意图</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>相信自己值得-</span><strong><span>能量对齐</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>采取行动，并接收 - </span><strong><span>不抗拒</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>✨其他</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>感情的核心是没有什么可依赖</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>对负面能量选择不回应</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>女人倒霉的第一步，就是频繁地给男人发消息</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>女人不需要爱情，需要的是金钱和权利</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如果一直很顺利，就不要随意改变自己的行为路径</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>钱是一种能量，先感受到金钱感，才会来财</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>保护好自己的注意力</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>💬听友群二维码，进来聊聊吧</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flq7HMdTNPYOohn2RHRI5D7ukpnx.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiO_W363H8J9GGJN0gKSMqDYuP4U.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63397169bf02f153ce0caa9c/lgOjfmrTAiv4aWGwaIAHknCYsFgM.m4a" length="71345725" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:27</itunes:duration>
