    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>7月的碎碎念哈，有些感悟随机分享❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 很累的周一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 我不理解为什么很多人对rooftop bar的执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 招人很难，本月困苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 怎么又唱歌了哈哈哈哈哈哈 《他不懂》送给你，希望你不会体会到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">09:34</a> 见客户，也见人性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 我脑海里不知道咋都是美美桑拿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 维也纳文学分享一页</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 给大家读书，假装自己是许知远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 人性经不起考验以及i dont wanna know 哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 关于查男朋友手机的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> 早餐后的感悟分享，感情和生活的最高境界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 咋又唱歌了，英文歌也不要放过</span></p><span></span><p><span>That's it, 周一快乐，祝本周发财&amp;平安喜乐❤️</span></p>]]></description>
