    <guid isPermaLink="false">6870d70e60f8f77d4001b362</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Jul 2025 09:24:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本系列是🗺️</span><strong><span>带你听世界</span></strong><span>🗺️，走在不同城市，会录下城市的小贩叫卖声，机场转机提示声，和朋友的悠闲交谈等。目的是制作一个小型空间转换器，如果可以让你忘记一秒钟自己所处的现实，那就算小小胜利。✌</span></p><span></span><p><span>清新胡志明居住2周体验，远程工作福地。</span><strong><span>最近生活很简单：工作，普拉提，睡觉。🍃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨本集大纲✨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> Greeting from HCMC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">02:14</a> Mandy还不出现？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> 在胡志明第一周经历了低能量，调整定律分享给大家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 日本弟弟Irori来越南啦，我们之前在国际大厂工作，后来在纽约，迪拜都见了面，这次居然胡志明又碰上了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 普拉提课后碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> 最近很喜欢用habit tracker</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 一些idea记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 寺庙师傅上一集给我算让我不要有太多想法，but 日子还是要过的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1531">25:31</a> 吃海底捞highle之后给大家唱个歌儿哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 关于胡志明的9个观察</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgweSq1a6YdF48hBBm-4Yove4tXK.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>河边的网球场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhs9o6zIcsvSTeErUW1TPBKDV_Xc.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>普拉提普拉提，天天搞起</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1Ck8tRL4T5jhELJxGruG-sT8wi.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>工作&amp;学习，隐蔽法式洋楼改的咖啡厅workshop</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上，</span></p><span></span><p><span>就这样啦！大家周末愉快❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请进！这里学习打卡，健身打卡，日常纠结烦闷等各种天儿聊起✌️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkrnb785r0PJrS3uJJJyk8M6VdL5.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVeJKOW-_SdQ5GGqe2KT-csWnWz.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
