  <item>
    <title>EP 74｜记一次公路旅行，德国到意大利，无惊无险小有刺激</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682c92d5fcbc2e206be5f6aa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682c92d5fcbc2e206be5f6aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 14:39:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本系列是</span><strong><span>🗺️带你听世界</span></strong><span>🗺️，走在不同城市，会录下城市的小贩叫卖声，机场转机提示声，和朋友的悠闲交谈等。目的是制作一个小型空间转换器，如果可以让你忘记一秒钟自己所处的现实，那就算小小胜利。✌</span></p><span></span><p><span>无目的的美好生活，德国见完家人朋友，一路向南，到西西里。岛民生活在延续，想起来都是明晃晃的阳光，必须带墨镜的那种。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨本集大纲✨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 羞涩开头，还好棒球给我递了一杯酒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 远距离恋爱这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 落地柏林，进入德语rap世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 在柏林的第二天，晚餐与新朋友就朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 棒球和朋友聊VISA，算是一直在我身边也感同身受了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> 聊了英国电影，谈到《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304585/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1304585/"><span>BJ单身日记</span></a><span>》和《</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1301582/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1301582/"><span>Bitter Moon</span></a><span>》（最喜欢爱情电影之一）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="796">13:16</a> 车内卡拉OK（我现在听到棒球声音就想哭，我很想他，该死的爱情）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 周末去给棒球妈妈庆祝生日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 开车搭轮渡，终于到了西西里岛第一站：Messina</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 来聊一聊西方人为啥不爱来中国旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a> 关于亚洲旅行，西方人需要更多的education</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1399">23:19</a> 棒球男孩很迷《教父》，拍摄地也在西西里，但我不想戳破他的泡泡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1533">25:33</a> 西西里必须要做的事：去酒庄！🍇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a> 推荐</span><a href="https://www.planeta.it/en/" data-url="https://www.planeta.it/en/"><span>Planeta Winery</span></a><span>，我爱他们家的</span><a href="https://www.planeta.it/en/wines/terebinto/" data-url="https://www.planeta.it/en/wines/terebinto/"><span>Planeta Terebinto</span></a><span>，棒球还买了一箱回家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 棒球对买房有了执念，见谁跟谁聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 酒醉的英文，请大家多担待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2364">39:24</a> 西西里首府Palermo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2489">41:29</a> 一个煮咖啡学德语的早上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 西西里在下雨，我在广场咖啡厅思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">46:58</a> 旅行结束，生活继续</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些照片📷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftxvsz4xIawQyyQtv1wronWI1uam.png"></figure><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.meibier.de/c/brauereien/winkler-braeu" data-url="https://www.meibier.de/c/brauereien/winkler-braeu"><span>Winkler Bräu</span></a><span> 不爱喝啤酒的我喝了很多，我们带了一箱在车里（btw我的指甲真好看）</span></h1><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAH0tHWMVV6G4fYj_gWTti03lj1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>拜仁的老酒店，窗外是教堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fni6F92sM8MnbYHAxJSYvTWewGhc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Montepulciano的托斯卡纳式的夕阳，老城区好看，附近有酒庄</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FttUxMNcUIspnIF1TsKt2l6rSWcq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>盘山公路上，能看到山海湖河</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkz-XZU_LYhi4W0Pt0bDX4AnQ318.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>我们在西西里的家，host是建筑师，这里以前是他的家族办公室</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsKA58iD1lounYHY1LFZjmBf2e16.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>一张他拍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_jZ0iqK_lE7fC7w7NhjEKREk_-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Planeta酒庄旗下餐厅La Foresteria</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYIiZ_9FXd3p4l7yfWcEgrpoo-P.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLL8f_NhsswskLFTrUrqa4Z8jkT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>另一张他拍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuy9YNcyBm1T6y1ghpvYBZcwvVGY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Scala dei Turchi的白色悬崖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgBwC47FLqw2dJ13O9fNDFzs27d.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Doric Temple of Segesta，其历史可追溯到公元前五世纪。看到🌈了么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3vBHcmqpJG690G4TUESo2tvGr2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Scopello小镇的海之一</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTlI5Fn7XIFWgo0w67UG_KpvG_7.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Scopello小镇的海之二</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上，</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>今年除了3月到4月一个月，我们都待在一起了。相比前两年，一年才见30多天。已经很知足，感恩宇宙❤️</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>下次在哪儿见呢？no idea yet, but will keep you updated！</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群二维码在这里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSLWwLhUxT7Lg_jLMDEflYb7y41.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqSYPkjmRfT8kiEG0tM4vglab8uJ.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
